flowchart LR
  User[SME team] --> React[React workspace]
  React --> Proxy[Vite or Nginx same-origin proxy]
  Proxy --> API[Django REST API]
  API --> Auth[Session auth and tenant permissions]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL deployment / SQLite fallback)]
  API --> Media[Private validated media]
  API --> CV[OpenCV HSV palette audit]
  API --> NLP[Local model or explicit keyword assistance]
  API --> Risk[Sourced rules and editorial heuristics]
  API --> Forecast[ARIMA / optional Prophet]
  API --> Review[Independent human approval]
  Review --> Ready[Ready to publish manually]
